WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Water the bed well before you put down mulch.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Spread straw or other coarse mulch over the soil like a blanket.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Use five to ten centimetres of coarse mulch. Spread fine grass clippings more thinly.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Leave about five centimetres clear around vegetable stems so they can dry.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Watch rain soak into the covered soil. Under the mulch, moisture lasts longer.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Top up the mulch as it breaks down. Keep the gap around the stems.
